Added golang template string manipulation functions, contains, hasPrefix, hasSuffix, split. Uncovered and corrected a bug where the Template.Execute block drops custom registered functions. Extended test suite to cover these new template functions. 
These have been introduced to support DeepSeek R1 models, their training templates elide old '<think>' blocks as the conversation progresses.
Supporting this use case;
